{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabies erupts without warning, rupturing the young policeman\u2019s placid existence. Condemned by this incurable, lifelong affliction, he confronts an agonizing ultimatum: surrender his badge to reality\u2019s demands, or bury his sickness to hunt the truth behind his infection. This is merely the prologue. When fate beckons him down a path drenched in shadows, his investigation will drag into the light this city\u2019s most sordid secrets\u2014corruption festering through decades, bleeding into the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Razor-sharp pacing:</strong> Zero filler; every detail fuels the core mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic sequences:</strong> Every frame intensifies the narrative weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive soundscape:</strong> 100+ SFX pull you deeper into the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linear destiny:</strong> Become fate\u2019s accomplice in his desperate struggle.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A New Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3763930/dee2efa9290c684268d47d0f52dbc49e96290d8a.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763930?t=1759226427","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763930?t=1759226427","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763930/a3ab171d022dcba733cfb45aa06ec1bf466b9e87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759226427","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763930/a3ab171d022dcba733cfb45aa06ec1bf466b9e87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759226427","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam